  law date 2025-06-30, cut 2026-10-25
q_rep_24: 3
  law date 2024-06-30, cut 2026-10-25
q_rep_25: 6
  law date 2025-06-30, cut 2026-10-25
q_rep_25_day: 6
  law date 2025-06-30, cut 2025-03-01
q_rep_25_old: 3
  law date 2025-06-30, cut 2025-02-01
